  "title": "EVE Online - 1 Multiple Pilot Training",
  "description": "Train more characters to grow your influence in New Eden! MPT is a simple way to skill up another character while skipping the hassle of juggling skill queues. \nActivate an MPT token and reap the benefits of up to two more skill queues! ",
  "longDescription": "\n# Train more characters to grow your influence in New Eden. Get MPT today and skill up in EVE Online!\n\nMultiple Pilot Training (MPT) is a simple way to skill up an extra character while skipping the hassle of juggling skill queues or accounts. Activate the MPT token from your redemption queue in-game and start training up to two additional characters at the same time! Try something new on a second character today. \n\n- Double Your Training - Train up to two additional characters without pausing skill training on your main.\n- Do Anything - Capital pilot? Market or industry alt? The choice is yours.\n- Convenience Built-In - MPT makes it easy to avoid the hassle of juggling skill queues or accounts",
